{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15344310","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15344310","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1534431001:0":{"text":"拿出点雅库伯尔的气概来！别哆哆嗦嗦地躲在树丛最里面！","source_cn":"拿出点雅库伯尔的气概来！别哆哆嗦嗦地躲在树丛最里面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD792C1DEDB3FF16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1534431002:0":{"text":"壮，你真可靠！","source_cn":"壮，你真可靠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0232E49454A94109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1534431003:0":{"text":"明明自己怕得要死，拼命往树丛里躲……","source_cn":"明明自己怕得要死，拼命往树丛里躲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A53390166C6D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1534431004:0":{"text":"不对啊，按照恐怖故事的记录，我们应该已经进入死人的世界了，接下来做个仪式就能被传送回营地……","source_cn":"不对啊，按照恐怖故事的记录，我们应该已经进入死人的世界...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x474E14EBBE3F5EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1534431005:0":{"text":"什么乱七八糟的？","source_cn":"什么乱七八糟的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BACC692D6CE78D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1534431006:0":